How this brain reaches the outside world. Connector-first. No tokens are stored in this vault.

{{integrations_table}}

**Manual-tier capabilities** are reached by the user pasting content or by a small script with a token kept outside the vault. Never put a token in a markdown file.

**Native apps with no API at all** are reached through **Claude Cowork**, Anthropic's desktop agent. It operates the app directly on the desktop with you steering. Use it for the tools nothing else can reach. Link [[user-profile]].
